{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkl_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkl_05_title", "source_sha256": "701be736087e688ba96285ad631821ff8d63a9603cc72ab9d9f1f68e8e5a0fd9", "ja": "ouverture：ハーモニクス", "zh": "ouverture：Harmonics", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkl_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkl_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1041db1a98c288f5f41b0a6e0e147d85f951c5d5d131e4b4640c79d100e28e25", "ja": "ジュリアと静香。互いをリスペクトするから\nこそ衝突し、思い悩む二人。\n葛藤の先にあるステージで、少女たちを\n待ち受けるものは…？", "zh": "茱莉亚和静香两人敬佩彼此，\n却也因此产生冲突，陷入烦恼。\n纠葛过后，在舞台上等着少女们的是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkl_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkl_05_1000_050jul", "source_sha256": "2a4a2a22bc2beceaa5edb1358a0342abf00a81e226525cc0fac0c70ebc74a8f4", "ja": "やるに決まってるだろ、プロデューサー！", "zh": "当然要做啊，制作人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkl_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkl_05_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "4ca1baea7bfabf86ea14bdfef1fd3b401fff6b29bfa585ee7cb4e4fdb5f60ad8", "ja": "そんなの、聞くまでもないじゃないですか！　ジュリア\nさんとのデュオだなんて、嬉しいに決まってます！", "zh": "这种事情还需要问吗！？\n能和茱莉亚组成双人组，我当然很乐意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkl_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkl_05_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "44d691db324958f0ba6bd30b5bad3fa03d680d9dcfb18ba2e9f7632903f40105", "ja": "最高のユニットにしてやろうぜ、シズ！", "zh": "咱们要打造出最棒的组合，静香！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkl_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkl_05_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "a66ef4275ee74e9d133890fef6c29ee68a58381333f69a42dca32dffbf882c6e", "ja": "悪いな、二人とも。もうあたしには、\n最高の相棒がいるんでね。……な、シズ！", "zh": "抱歉啦，你们两个。不过我已经有最棒的搭档了。……对吧，静香！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkl_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkl_05_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "c3f7673b639a893708d0e9128b45853192b79fc40895c22f623635bb5bfbf8ae", "ja": "『二人の歌』……？", "zh": "『两人的歌』……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkl_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkl_05_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "5018ec079f598ebf3d82b4a9b18a10dc98f62582faf3f0d86150cd6f05fea67f", "ja": "それだけじゃダメなんだ。二人でどう歌うか……。\nどんなロックにするか、イメージを合わせないと。", "zh": "光是这样还不行。两个人要怎么唱……  \n得先统一好要做成什么样的摇滚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkl_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkl_05_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "4c8da2a29e1ba12549620f358b5ac3e5f6d13adc787cb09118eaacd64ad995c7", "ja": "そんなの当たり前じゃないですか！\n私だって、二人できちんとこの曲に向き合いたいです！", "zh": "那不是理所当然的吗！\n我也想和你一起认真面对这首歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkl_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkl_05_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "e70ae3df0eb8d0d92a948e694534976c89eb0f39b5896295be50ac105c6e9ebc", "ja": "でも……。私、", "zh": "可是……我，", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkl_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkl_05_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "e404514e1e09d7cfe21a92b22125c19c49ce82f54dd5e5a558fad9c0c50817c2", "ja": "あたしにとってのロックとも違う。\nシズは、たぶん……もっと……。", "zh": "这与我对摇滚的情感又有所不同，\n静她大概……更加……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_007_fkl_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_007_fkl_05_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "dbcc2a11e1fcc96701ec2fa251a82e683ff22ec29ea77a6bc9de1f6bcb0a903b", "ja": "でもひとつだけ、わかったことがあります。\nそれは……。", "zh": "不过，我明白了一件事。\n那就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
